<figure id="S5.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE VI: </span>The impact of introducing the embedding layer only to the attacker’s bottom model</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
