mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde{\mathrm{emb}}_{i}=\widehat{\mathrm{emb}}+\delta,\ \delta\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\mu,\sigma^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l18.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
